{"id":"4070b2f37a2197f6","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-ap.md","title":"df-ap (Alternating Polynomial Time)","display":"df-ap (Alternating Polynomial Time)","type":"definition","metadata":{"book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","depends_on":["[[28-df-atm]]"],"display":"df-ap (Alternating Polynomial Time)","label":"28-df-ap","type":"definition","aliases":["28-df-ap","AP","Alternating Polynomial Time"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9efd20f439611336\" href=\"?note=9efd20f439611336\" title=\"28-df-atm\">28-df-atm</a></span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-ap (Alternating Polynomial Time)"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-ap"},{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-ap</span><span>AP</span><span>Alternating Polynomial Time</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{ATIME}(t)\">\\(\\mathbf{ATIME}(t)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9efd20f439611336\" href=\"?note=9efd20f439611336\" title=\"28-df-atm\">28-df-atm</a>，按每分支时间最坏值并容许常数因子。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{AP}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{a\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}}\\mathbf{ATIME}(n\\mapsto(n+2)^a).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbf{AP}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{a\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}}\\mathbf{ATIME}(n\\mapsto(n+2)^a).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>允许沿计算分支发生多项式多次交替；PH 的交替块数由与输入无关的常数限制。</p>\n<p>来源核对：§5.3.1；印刷100页；PDF126页。定义已核对。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-atm","status":"resolved","id":"9efd20f439611336","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-atm]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-atm","status":"resolved","id":"9efd20f439611336","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbf{ATIME}(t)$ 见 [[28-df-atm]]，按每分支时间最坏值并容许常数因子。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbf{ATIME}(t)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{AP}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{a\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}}\\mathbf{ATIME}(n\\mapsto(n+2)^a).","display":true}],"bytes":729,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-89","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"交替计算：[[28-df-atm]]、[[28-df-ap]]、[[28-thm-ap-equals-pspace]]。"},{"id":"13847817d539efaf","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["9efd20f439611336"]}